--- !u!114 &1076967291
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1076967288}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a6dcabeef34d1e4b924267cdb708e5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  filePath: Assets/Dialogues/IdleNPC-Ashley_Dialogue01.json
  commands:
  - rid: 5301360840518139970
  - rid: 5301360840518139971
  - rid: 5301360840518139972
  - rid: 5301360840518139973
  - rid: 5301360840518139974
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 5301360840518139970
      type: {class: ShowTextCommand, ns: RPGDialogueSystem, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        speakerName: Bell
        speakerAnimParam: player
        boxColorHex: '#FFD8C4'
        text: No termino de entender que estan haciendo esos dos chicos
    - rid: 5301360840518139971
      type: {class: ShowTextCommand, ns: RPGDialogueSystem, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        speakerName: Ashley
        speakerAnimParam: ashley
        boxColorHex: '#FF88CB'
        text: Estan en una batalla de granjear presencia.
    - rid: 5301360840518139972
      type: {class: ShowTextCommand, ns: RPGDialogueSystem, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        speakerName: Ashley
        speakerAnimParam: ashley
        boxColorHex: '#FF88CB'
        text: Los chicos y chicas se agrupan para expresarse en espacios publicos
    - rid: 5301360840518139973
      type: {class: ShowTextCommand, ns: RPGDialogueSystem, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        speakerName: Ashley
        speakerAnimParam: ashley
        boxColorHex: '#FF88CB'
        text: La verdad no perjudican a nadie. Pero, a ciertos adultos, por algun
          motivo les hace enojar bastante
    - rid: 5301360840518139974
      type: {class: ShowTextCommand, ns: RPGDialogueSystem, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        speakerName: Bell
        speakerAnimParam: player
        boxColorHex: '#FFD8C4'
        text: No entiendo por que a un adulto funcional le molestaria algo asi. Suena
          bastante genial.
